      "extractPrompt": "只输出 JSON：\n{\"first_entity_type\":\"\",\"first_entity_name\":\"\",\"second_entity_type\":\"\",\"second_entity_name\":\"\",\"date_range\":{\"date_text\":\"\",\"week\":null,\"weekday\":null},\"period_scope\":null,\"inherited\":false}\nA班/B班归一化为2025级A班/2025级B班。只给一个对象时第二对象留空；不预判冲突，不单独输出顶层 date_text/week/weekday。",
      "tool": "compare_schedules",
